# FitTrack AI — environment variables
#
# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in the values.
#
# The two VITE_ variables below are bundled into the browser. They are safe to
# expose because row level security is what protects user data, not secrecy of
# these values. Never put a service-role key or an AI provider key here.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Server-side only. These belong in Supabase Edge Function secrets, NEVER in a
# file that Vite reads and bundles, and never prefixed with VITE_.
#
#   OPENAI_API_KEY    required for the AI food scanner and the weekly coach
#   AI_VISION_MODEL   optional, defaults to gpt-4o-mini
#   AI_TEXT_MODEL     optional, defaults to gpt-4o-mini
#
# SUPABASE_URL, SUPABASE_ANON_KEY and SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY are provided
# automatically to Edge Functions by the platform and do not need setting.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
